    "title": "Implement the read-only verified runtime resolver",
    "summary": "Replace the unused privateRuntimePaths constructor with the approved async resolver, implemented through the proposed runtime-store module. Verify explicit home/full identity, protected canonical root, independent policy-bound inventory and exact Node/npm/header file set, with no allocation or application imports.",
    "size": "M",
    "order": 2,
    "acceptanceChecks": [
      "Direct calls return frozen canonical absolute runtime paths only for the exact verified identity; tampered files/metadata, extra files, bad target/baseline, links and unsafe roots fail closed.",
